												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #2b0000; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>欢迎!</p> <p>这是一个为所有SCP文档和相关外围中出现的人气基金会虚构概念的蓝图的设定中心，比如说人形物体收容隔间和安全物品锁柜。</p> <p>如果你想往这个列表里添加和/或是想要请求一篇SCP文档，外围，中的虚构科技，或是纯粹的背景润色文本，联系<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-reach" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1779895&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607671281" alt="Dr Reach" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1779895)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-reach" >Dr Reach</a></span>或是<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-1068518/reach-s-blueprint-folder">在这页的讨论帖中【主站】</a>或是原帖<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-1056361/foundation-mock-up-blueprints">Foundation Mock-up Blueprints thread【主站】.</a>中留言。欢迎任何添加或是建议！</p> <p>希望你喜欢！</p> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/1.png" width="100px" alt="1.png" class="image" /></div> <h1><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><strong>基金会标准设施</strong></span></span></h1> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;异常载具收容车库</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;Crayne!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>异常载具收容车库</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/23js4di.jpg" width="570px" alt="23js4di.jpg" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">前往 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1946">SCP-1946</a> 和 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2445">SCP-2445</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;FLAT设施&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;Photosynthetic&nbsp;and&nbsp;Kaktus!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>文件排序自动化任务室</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/2zz2hs7.jpg" width="570px" alt="2zz2hs7.jpg" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">这是我想象中基金会在Sites和Area里会对一大部分 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/safe">Safe</a> 级项目和 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items">异常物品</a>使用的设备，像是，比如说，圣物Sites；而且，这是一个把敏感信息保持在不可获取状态下的好办法。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;无实体个体用真空室</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;Kaktus!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>无实体个体用真空室</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/2i0zlux.png" width="570px" alt="2i0zlux.png" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">去看看 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2996">SCP-2996</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;异常实体用恒温装置</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;Tagliafierro!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>A级异常实体用恒温装置</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/2je8k5i.png" width="570px" alt="2je8k5i.png" class="image" /> <p>稍微改良的版本 (原本的恒温装置是设计给外星生物用的，但是既然它们需要恒温箱，为什么不能和异常宝宝用相同的恒温箱模组呢？), 当然这确实是Tagliafierro的作品带来的灵感.</p> <p style="text-align: center;">去看看<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2115">SCP-2115</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;标准人形异常收容间Type&nbsp;S</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;Crayne!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>小型标准人形异常收容间</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/52flhd.png" width="570px" alt="52flhd.png" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">我本来是想找不同称呼的“标准收容间”来匹配不同的个体，但是，呃…… <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/search:site/a/p/q/%22%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E4%BA%BA%E5%BD%A2%22">你不会打算让我把每个用人形个体收容间收容的SCP都列在这里对吧!</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;标准人形异常收容间Type&nbsp;M</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;Crayne!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>中型标准人形异常收容间</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/2q1hy69.png" width="570px" alt="2q1hy69.png" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">去看看 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1119">SCP-1119</a>! 还有那些需要比“小型”或者“标准”尺寸更大的人形异常收容间收容的个体，当然这很可能数不过来。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/2.png" width="100px" alt="2.png" class="image" /></div> <h1><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><strong>技术和设备</strong></span></span></h1> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;空气传送与饱和一体化系统&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Prepping&nbsp;for&nbsp;bigger&nbsp;things!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>空气传送与饱和一体化系统</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/21nnrqc.png" width="570px" alt="21nnrqc.png" class="image" /><br /> 我觉得这算是显而易见啦：这个AID&amp;SS 其实是为了改进 DAESS (下面那个图纸）的造型和设计专门创造的。不过 以后这东西可能还会用在更先进更酷的那些需要快速散播气基药剂的基金会技术实例上面。目前而言，就注意下这是个&quot;已经存在的东西&quot;了。</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;二氰乙炔-氟化铝紧急饱和系统&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Created&nbsp;by&nbsp;Crayne!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>二氰乙炔-氟化铝紧急饱和系统</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/2a4wn03.jpg" width="570px" alt="2a4wn03.jpg" class="image" /> <p>这是为了当你那平淡无常的安保或是收容措施不够格时，而你需要的仅仅是那房间内的一切都<strong>燃烧起来</strong>!! 接着 <strong>爆炸</strong>!! 同时地。</p> <p style="text-align: center;">前往 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2102">SCP-2102</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;非实体置换中和器阵列</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;Kaktus!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>非实体置换中和器阵列</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/npdna_by_longlininin-darboti.jpg" width="570px" alt="npdna_by_longlininin-darboti.jpg" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">前往 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2996">SCP-2996</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;斯克兰顿现实稳定锚</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Inspired&nbsp;by&nbsp;Reject!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>斯克兰顿现实稳定锚</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/srb_by_longlininin-dar9hjp.jpg" width="570px" alt="srb_by_longlininin-dar9hjp.jpg" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">前往 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1451">SCP-1451</a> 和 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2000">SCP-2000</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;标准物品收容单位&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;various&nbsp;users&nbsp;in&nbsp;chat!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>标准安全柜单位</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/33vjcb9.jpg" width="570px" alt="33vjcb9.jpg" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/search:site/a/p/q/%22%E6%9F%9C%22">如果我需要链接你到每一次锁柜被使用在了SCP文档里，我们是永远都完不成的。</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;标准安全箱</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Suggested&nbsp;by&nbsp;various&nbsp;users&nbsp;in&nbsp;chat!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>标准安全箱</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/ssc_by_longlininin-darbpgg.jpg" width="570px" alt="ssc_by_longlininin-darbpgg.jpg" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">什么,你以为基金会在站点疏散时都会徒手把<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/safe">Safe</a>项目和<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items">异常物品</a>运走？</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;Xyank-Anastasakos连续时间槽</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Created&nbsp;by&nbsp;FortuneFavorsBold!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>Xyank-Anastasakos连续时间槽</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/xacts_by_longlininin-darbzqh.jpg" width="570px" alt="xacts_by_longlininin-darbzqh.jpg" class="image" /> <p>虽然这是那个来自我们都知道和喜欢的SCP-2000的设备的简单便携版，但它也可以代表在由<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/document-1780-wl">RCT-Δt</a>或他们的特工处理时，时间槽实际上看起来的样子。</p> <p style="text-align: center;">前往 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2000">SCP-2000</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/3.png" width="100px" alt="3.png" class="image" /></div> <h1><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><strong>特殊收容措施</strong></span></span></h1> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;SCP-001,&nbsp;Roget的提案&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Created&nbsp;by&nbsp;Roget!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #2b0000; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#2b0000">SCP-001/Roget : KETER 任务</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/dd0z2u.jpg" width="570px" alt="dd0z2u.jpg" class="image" /> <p>SCP-001-Roget, 著名却又臭名昭著的Keter任务。当你习惯了以后它其实并不是那么糟，真的。它只不过是每个存在的Keter都要一个希腊符号，然后成对的共享着收容间。然后怎么成对的，我滴主啊，怎么是成对的啊。。。</p> <p>这个蓝图是对这篇文档的一个自由解读，本来是用于2014年的第三次艺术交换(<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-1059904/3rd-annual-scp-holiday-art-exchange">the Third Art Exchange of 2014</a>)，但是Roget看起来很喜欢它，所以我想把它帖在这还是挺合适的。</p> <p style="text-align: center;">前往 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/roget-s-proposal">Roget的提案</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;SCP-2722</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Created&nbsp;by&nbsp;Von&nbsp;Pincier!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #2b0000; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#2b0000">SCP- 2722 - SCPSS <em>团结号</em></span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/sg0kle.jpg" width="570px" alt="sg0kle.jpg" class="image" /> <p>SCP-2722的大体构图，我也许以后会加一个模板，但我已经对它投入太多时间了，这个项目花了我太久了，但我对结果非常满意。剩下的就慢慢等着吧。</p> <p>除此之外，对于Area-08作为一个基金会太空站的引用使我感到开心。三文鱼标志的出处是因为Area-08是位于中大西洋之上的，但那就是另一个故事了。</p> <p>感谢聊天室内的大家对于这篇的反馈。</p> <p style="text-align: center;">前往 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2722">SCP-2722</a>!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/4.png" width="100px" alt="4.png" class="image" /></div> <h1><span><span style="color:#0044a3"><strong>奖励回合!</strong></span></span></h1> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">++&nbsp;RANDOMINI眼中的AWCY</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">--&nbsp;Created&nbsp;by&nbsp;Randomini,&nbsp;duh.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="float: center; border: double 2px #0044a3; width: 570px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h2><span><span style="color:#0044a3">RANDOMINI眼中的AWCY</span></span></h2> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/reach-s-blueprint-folder/2uh0klz.jpg" width="570px" alt="2uh0klz.jpg" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">不是说在这种情况下，还是在任何情况下，它是完全有关的，因为Randomini的故事是大家都知道&#8230;但如果你由于某种原因 <strong>还没</strong> 读过它们, 把你的时间先用到对的地方并前往 <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-cool-war-hub">Cool之战</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ze-gui" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1767122&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607671281" alt="Ze_Gui" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1767122)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ze-gui" >Ze_Gui</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
