&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-472006-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. TV动画jojo的奇妙冒险：不灭钻石主题曲&lt;/div&gt;
